  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Rags by Jak is an independent UK fashion brand creating alternative, avant-garde streetwear with real construction and purpose.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Most of our garments are <strong>made to order or produced in small batches</strong> in our studio in Bury St Edmunds. We work with heavyweight fabrics, technical detailing, and experimental silhouettes designed to be worn properly and last.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Our community comes to us for clothing that feels different because it’s built differently.<br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Affiliate Programme</strong><br></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">Our affiliate programme is built for people who genuinely connect with the brand. This isn’t about hard selling or scripted content. It’s about <strong>wearing the pieces, styling them your way, and sharing them naturally</strong> with your audience.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">As an affiliate, you’ll receive:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>A unique referral link </p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>10% commission on every sale you generate</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Early access to drops and updates</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>A closer connection to how the brand evolves</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">We see affiliates as an extension of the brand, not just a marketing channel.</span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong>Who This Is For</strong></span></p><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">This programme is ideal for:</span></p><ul><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Fashion creators and stylists</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Alternative / avant-garde wearers</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>People who care about quality, fit, and construction</p></li><li style=\"font-size:14px;\"><p>Related blogs, magazines, Youtube channels</p></li></ul><p><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">If the brand resonates with you, your audience will feel it too.</span></p></div></div>",
